cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use addlib, please cite it as below."
title: "addlib: a worked example of an open-source C+Python library"
abstract: >-
  A minimal library that adds two numbers in C and exposes the result to Python
  via a CFFI ABI, and doubles as a template for building, testing, and releasing a
  native Python library.
type: software
authors:
